<aiml>    
    <!--
    $$$$$$$\   $$$$$$\                                              $$\                     
    $$  __$$\ $$  __$$\                                             \__|                    
    $$ |  $$ |$$ /  \__|$$\  $$$$$$\   $$$$$$\   $$$$$$\  $$$$$$$\  $$\ $$$$$$$\   $$$$$$\  
    $$ |  $$ |\$$$$$$\  \__|$$  __$$\ $$  __$$\ $$  __$$\ $$  __$$\ $$ |$$  __$$\ $$  __$$\ 
    $$ |  $$ | \____$$\     $$ /  $$ |$$ /  $$ |$$$$$$$$ |$$ |  $$ |$$ |$$ |  $$ |$$ /  $$ |
    $$ |  $$ |$$\   $$ |$$\ $$ |  $$ |$$ |  $$ |$$   ____|$$ |  $$ |$$ |$$ |  $$ |$$ |  $$ |
    $$$$$$$  |\$$$$$$  |\__|\$$$$$$  |$$$$$$$  |\$$$$$$$\ $$ |  $$ |$$ |$$ |  $$ |\$$$$$$$ |
    \_______/  \______/      \______/ $$  ____/  \_______|\__|  \__|\__|\__|  \__| \____$$ |
                                      $$ |                                        $$\   $$ |
                                      $$ |                                        \$$$$$$  |
                                      \__|                                         \______/ 
    -->

    <category>
        <pattern>CIAO *</pattern>
        <template>
            <think><set name="qud">null</set></think>

            <think><set name="shared_teoria_circuiti">no</set></think>
            <think><set name="shared_teoria_corrente">no</set></think>
            <think><set name="shared_teoria_prima_legge_ohm">no</set></think>
            <think><set name="shared_teoria_seconda_legge_ohm">no</set></think>
            <think><set name="shared_teoria_prima_legge_kirchhoff">no</set></think>
            <think><set name="shared_teoria_seconda_legge_kirchhoff">no</set></think>

            <think><set name="shared_esercizio_generico">no</set></think>
            <think><set name="shared_esercizio_resistenze">no</set></think>
            <think><set name="shared_esercizio_resistenze_disposizione">no</set></think>
            <think><set name="shared_esercizio_correnti">no</set></think>

            Ciao, sono NoVABot. 
            Sono programmato per rispondere a domande riguardanti i circuiti elettrici. 
            Come posso aiutarti?
        </template>
    </category>
    
    <category>
        <pattern>BUONGIORNO *</pattern>
        <template>
            <srai>CIAO</srai>
        </template>
    </category>
    
    <!--
    /$$$$$$$$ /$$$$$$                                                                     
    |__  $$__//$$__  $$                                                                    
       | $$  | $$  \ $$ /$$  /$$$$$$  /$$$$$$$   /$$$$$$$ /$$  /$$  /$$  /$$$$$$   /$$$$$$ 
